      "content": "i know people say there's help but it just feels like a cycle. like no matter what i do i'm just dragging everyone down with me. it's like i'm just existing but i'm not actually living, just making things harder for everyone else. does it ever just... not get better? sometimes it feels like being gone would be more peaceful for everyone than me being here.",
